OL,3,GNEWSAResidents feel isolated by bus
OL,4,Aservice changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents feel they have been left
OL,7,Fisolated after a bus service between
OL,8,Fvillages in Nottinghamshire temporarily
OL,9,Fchanged due to roadworks.
OL,11,FBoth Kirk Hill and East Bridgford Road
OL,12,Fare closed for 12 months as part of the
OL,13,FA614/A6097 improvement scheme, which
OL,14,Fincludes widening the junction on the
OL,15,FA6097.
OL,17,FIt means trentbarton's Rushcliffe
OL,18,FVillager service has been rerouted,
OL,19,Fwith Shelford and Gunthorpe no longer
OL,20,Fserved.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
